# 📌 api.http — Dummy Non-Persistent Product API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081/api/products

### 1️⃣ Get All Products

GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2️⃣ Get Product by ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/0

### 3️⃣ Create Product

POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "price": 12000000
}

### 4️⃣ Update Product

PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "price": 18000000
}

### 5️⃣ Delete Product

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1
